ds)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate via proximity chat or walkie-talkies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 planets to land on (and probably die on)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ monsters to scream at</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hammer to stun and capture creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunch of upgrades and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally-generated dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A caring, loving Corporation (legally obligated to say that)</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Planet Hoarders is a co-op game where you collect cute creatures to meet your quota in dark dungeons… and hide from the not-so-cute ones. You’re a replicant, grown by the Corporation for this exact mission. Will you obey without question?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291090/ea46b3ea6f264df3b99a2ccec7ef329e82c1d380/header.jpg?t=1766871149", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291090/4ee24cc61637acbd178f92facd0d63196955fe0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766871149", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291090/4ee24cc61637acbd178f92facd0d63196955fe0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766871149", "website": "http://imago.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 2.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bi